+| Alerts | `GET /api/alerts`, `POST /api/alerts/{id}/acknowledge`, `POST /api/alerts/{id}/resolve`, `GET /api/alerts/stats/summary` |
+| Predictions | `GET /api/predictions`, `GET /api/predictions/live` |
+| What-if | `GET /api/simulations/scenarios`, `POST /api/simulations/run`, `GET /api/simulations` |
