+
+Run the API test suite against a live backend:
+
+```bash
+python backend/test_api.py     # 66 checks: auth, RBAC, twin, CV, alerts, predictions,
+                               # what-if, demo, assistant, analytics, replay, report
+```
+
+## 🧠 AI modules (`backend/app/ai/`)
+
+| Module | Role |
+|---|---|
+| `engine.py` | Digital twin engine: live state, demo-mode sensor simulation, persistence, alerting, WebSocket broadcast |
+| `curves.py` | Campus behaviour models (diurnal crowd/parking/traffic/resource curves) shared by the seed history and the live twin |
+| `baselines.py` | Pattern learning: per-zone per-hour crowd statistics, parking ranges, resource baselines; anomaly scoring |
+| `predictor.py` | Explainable trend regression (predict +N min, time-to-threshold, growth rate) |
+| `risk.py` | Weighted campus risk score with contributors and reasons |
+| `whatif.py` | Scenario simulator: gate closure, event crowd, parking outage, event extension, vehicle surge, weather change |
+| `assistant.py` | Grounded natural-language decision assistant (rule-based intents over live data; optional LLM layer via `NEXUS_LLM_URL`) |
+| `report.py` | "Explain My Campus" daily AI report generator |
+| `vision.py` | OpenCV video/image analytics: MOG2 motion + Haar person detection + vehicle blobs + crowd density (auto-upgrades to YOLOv8 if `ultralytics` is installed) |
+
+## 🗄️ Project structure
+
+```
+neural-nexus/
+├── backend/                 # FastAPI main backend
+│   ├── app/
+│   │   ├── main.py          # app, routers, WebSocket endpoint
+│   │   ├── models.py        # 18 SQLAlchemy models
+│   │   ├── schemas.py       # Pydantic API schemas
+│   │   ├── security.py      # JWT + password hashing
+│   │   ├── routers/         # auth, campus, live, alerts, predictions,
+│   │   │                    # simulations, analytics, assistant, demo, admin
+│   │   └── ai/              # engine, baselines, predictor, risk, whatif,
+│   │                        # assistant, report, vision, curves
+│   ├── seed.py              # demo users, campus map, 30-day history
+│   └── test_api.py          # 66-check API test suite
+├── ai_service/              # separate AI processing microservice (OpenCV/YOLO)
+├── frontend/                # React + TypeScript + Tailwind + Recharts
+│   └── src/pages/           # Digital Twin, Cameras, Crowd, Parking, Events,
+│                            # Predictions, WHAT-IF, Alerts, Analytics,
+│                            # Assistant, Replay, Report, Settings
+├── docker-compose.yml       # postgres + backend + ai-service + frontend(nginx)
+└── README.md
+```
+
+## 🔒 Privacy & security
+
+- **Anonymous analytics only** — counting, density, movement. No facial recognition, no
+  individual tracking (enforced as a configurable, default-on privacy setting).
+- Camera RTSP credentials live only in the backend environment, never in the frontend.
+- JWT authentication with role-based access control; passwords hashed (PBKDF2/bcrypt).
+- Configurable data retention; automatic cleanup of old telemetry.
+
+## 🗺️ Roadmap
+
